<title>USA: DiversiFax unit buys three copier cos.</title>
<headline>DiversiFax unit buys three copier cos.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY STREAM, N.Y. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>DiversiFax Inc said Wednesday that its subsidiary, JA-Hunt Services Inc, has signed letters of intent to buy three photocopier sales and service companies.</p>
<p>The transaction is worth about $9 million. The acquisition is to be funded with an undisclosed combination of cash and DiversiFax stock.</p>
<p>The move comes a month after the JA-Hunt acquired two other photocopier companies for an undisclosed amount of cash and equity.</p>
